{"title":"비색의 풍차","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:ZFconbbxR1YmsuYBbHah","sourceHash":"e494014a64eaafe967177597cb2604d570271904c9153ddaa0bfe0b797f6890f","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":3.82,"end":10.1,"text":"廻る 回る 《緋色の風車》(ムーラン ルージュ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":10.1,"end":17.23,"text":"綺麗な花を 咲かせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":17.23,"end":23.86,"text":"躍る 踊る 《血色の風車》(ムーラン ルージュ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":23.86,"end":30.97,"text":"綺麗な花を 散らせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":86.2,"end":89.93,"text":"小さな掌に乗せた 硝子細工","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":89.93,"end":94.03,"text":"其の宝石を 『幸福』と謳うならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":94.03,"end":98.95,"text":"其の夜の蛮行は 時代に どんな爪痕を遺し","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":98.95,"end":104.12,"text":"彼等には どんな傷痕を残したのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":104.12,"end":105.86,"text":"運命に 翻弄される","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":105.86,"end":109.0,"text":"弱者の立場に嘆いた 少年は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":109.0,"end":112.09,"text":"やがて 『力』を欲するだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":112.09,"end":116.25,"text":"其れは 強大な力から 身を守る為の『楯』か？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":116.25,"end":123.58,"text":"其れとも より強大な力で それをも平らげる『剣』か？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":123.58,"end":131.79,"text":"何が起こったのか 良く解らなかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":131.79,"end":136.76,"text":"泣き叫ぶ 狂乱の 和音","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":136.76,"end":141.55,"text":"灼けた 屍肉の 風味","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":141.55,"end":150.35,"text":"何が襲ったのか 良く解らなかった けど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":150.35,"end":158.85,"text":"唯 ひとつ 此処に居ては 危ないと判った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":158.85,"end":161.04,"text":"僕は 一番大切な","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":161.04,"end":163.99,"text":"《宝物》(もの)を 持って 逃げようと →","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":163.99,"end":168.55,"text":"君の手を 掴んだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":168.55,"end":174.02,"text":"嗚呼 訳も解らず 息を切らせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":174.02,"end":177.57,"text":"走っていた 二人","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":177.57,"end":183.13,"text":"欲望が 溢れだすままに 暴れて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":183.13,"end":186.98,"text":"奴等は 追い掛けてくる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":219.72,"end":229.75,"text":"星屑を辿るように 森へ至る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":229.75,"end":234.56,"text":"闇に 潜んだままで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":234.56,"end":239.88,"text":"訳も解らず 息を殺して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":239.88,"end":243.39,"text":"震えていた 二人","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":243.39,"end":248.98,"text":"絶望が 溢れだすことを 怖れて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":248.98,"end":252.42,"text":"強く 抱き合っていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":252.42,"end":258.53,"text":"不意に 君の 肢体が 宙に浮かんだ →","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":258.53,"end":261.48,"text":"怯え縋るような 瞳が ←","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":261.48,"end":270.84,"text":"逃げ出した 僕の背中に 灼きついた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":274.09000000000003,"end":276.7,"text":"狂0105(お)しい 《季節》(とき)を経て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":276.7,"end":279.40999999999997,"text":"少年の 《時》は流転する","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":279.40999999999997,"end":283.76,"text":"廻る 回る 《緋色の風車》(ムーラン ルージュ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":283.76,"end":288.53,"text":"灼けつく 《刻》(とき)を 送って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":288.53,"end":292.76,"text":"躍る 踊る 《血色の風車》(ムーラン ルージュ)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":292.76,"end":297.02,"text":"凍える 《瞬間》(とき)を 迎えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":297.02,"end":301.85,"text":"嗚呼 もし生まれ変わったら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":301.85,"end":306.45,"text":"小さな花を 咲かせよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":306.45,"end":310.98,"text":"ごめんね 次は逃げずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":310.98,"end":315.18,"text":"君の傍で 共に散ろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":315.18,"end":324.5,"text":"Moulin Rouge","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":356.36,"end":358.97,"text":"「其処にロマンは在るのかしら？」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}